</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I would walk as if one blind,</l><l>Faith my only guide,</l><l>Understanding cast behind,</l><l>As a veil of night,</l><l>That I know real sight.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Sun of revelation, rise!</l><l>Gush, O vital stream!</l><l>That by light and flowing life,</l><l>Living I would be,</l><l>Fully one with Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Fruit most fragrant may You find,</l><l>Bursting with Your life,</l><l>Fully ready, wholly ripe,</l><l>Pleasing in Your sight;</l><l>You I would delight.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Come, dear hand of mercy, bring</l><l>Grace full supply!</l><l>For a love-filled out-pouring</l><l>Of my very life</l><l>On Your Body, Christ.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
